Before editing UI, reply **Matching:** `{id}` · `{page}` resolved from `frontend/src/livingSurfaces.js` (or **Need a surface:** `{which screen?}`). Page-specific do-nots live on that row. Procedure: `.cursor/skills/match-living-surface/SKILL.md`. Everything else is indexed in `docs/README.md`.
